.html:129:[Omitted long matching line]\\ndocs/diagnostics/AX199.html:27:<div id=\\\"output-0\\\"><pre tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code class=\\\"language-text\\\">[axylo AX199] &quot;Sessions&quot;: Axylo failed while building this chart: an error was thrown, printed above. If it comes from your code (a row getter, a callback), fix it there; otherwise it is a defect in Axylo: please report it with that error. The chart shows its error state.</code></pre></div>\\ndocs/diagnostics/AX199.html:31:<p>Read the error printed before the diagnostic. When it comes from your code, fix it there; the minimal input below is of that kind, a row whose getter throws. Otherwise it is a defect in Axylo: please report it with that error.</p>\\ndocs/updating.html:231:<p>Hints never throw. Neither do diagnostics found later while drawing, nor an internal failure while drawing (<a href=\\\"diagnostics/AX199.html\\\">AX199</a>): those are reported when found. A failure while the call itself is checked (a row getter that throws) rejects the call.</p>\"}]},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"037274e3-cc92-4f9f-9e50-c31045af83fe\",\"uuid\":\"2e7be751-73c0-4f3b-b400-7f9d0dfd31c0\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-19T08:32:35.464Z\",\"tool_use_result\":{\"mode\":\"content\",\"numFiles\":0,\"filenames\":[],\"content\":\"docs/diagnostics.html:82:[Omitted long matching line]\\ndocs/diagnostics.html:129:[Omitted long matching line]\\ndocs/diagnostics/AX199.html:27:<div id=\\\"output-0\\\"><pre tabindex=\\\"0\\\"><code cl\n\nCodex lookup 2026-11-19-codex-regional-sales-3-JikJY0/transcript.jsonl:30\n{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_14\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/bash -lc \\\"rg -n -o '.{0,70}<code>value</code></th>.{0,210}' docs/options.html\\\"\",\"aggregated_output\":\"101:n header of a scatter chart&#39;s table.</td></tr><tr><th scope=\\\"row\\\"><code>value</code></th><td>Value</td><td>The value axis title when several y fields share the axis and no name fits t